control: Units of work begun through every caller of a process share each account's token, each calling through its own caller
removes: each unit of work makes a token of its own from the record's credential, so a rotation one unit sees is lost to the others
packages: ./process/connections
tests: TestUnitsOfWorkThroughTwoCallersShareTheAccountsToken TestOverlappingRotationsEachLand TestATokenServesItsAccountUntilItsCredentialOrClientChanges
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

